Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).

License:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Attribution
-----------

Miller TE, El Farran CA, Couturier CP, et al.
Programs, origins and immunomodulatory functions of myeloid cells in glioma.
Nature. 2025;640:1072-1082.
https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-025-08633-8

Included reference files
------------------------

human_glioma_myeloid_k14.txt
    Human glioma myeloid K14 reference.

human_adult_glioma_allcell_k18.tsv
    Human adult diffuse glioma all-cell K18 reference.

mouse_glioma_myeloid_k14_ortholog.tsv
    Mouse ortholog-mapped version of the human glioma myeloid K14 reference.

Modifications
-------------

The mouse K14 reference was derived from the human glioma myeloid K14
reference by ortholog mapping for use with mouse gene symbols.

